# .github/workflows/
#
# Responsibility:
#   GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline definitions. This directory will contain:
#     - ci.yml       – Lint, test, and build on every push / PR
#     - deploy.yml   – Deploy to staging/production on merge to master
#     - docker.yml   – Build and push Docker images to registry
#
# Triggered by pushes and pull requests to dev and master branches.
